SUMMARY:Sunday Morning Yoga
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nStart your Sunday 
 with movement\, connection\, and a little time for yourself—then stick a
 round for a drink if you’d like!\n\nJoin us for a fun\, all-levels yoga 
 class at Lonerider Brewery in Wake Forest. Classes alternate between **Sta
 cey Paige and Kelly Klein**\, both experienced **E-RYT 500 yoga instructor
 s**.\n\nWhether you’re brand new to yoga or have been practicing for yea
 rs\, you’re welcome here. Come as you are\, move at your own pace\, and 
 enjoy a great way to kick off your Sunday.\n\n**A few details:**\n\n* 🧘
  All ages and experience levels welcome\n* 📍 Lonerider Brewery\, Wake F
 orest\n* 💰 Pay what you can: **$5 minimum / $10 suggested donation**\n*
  🧘‍♀️ Please bring your own yoga mat\n* 🍺 Stay afterward for a
  drink and hang out if you’d like!\n*\n\nNo need to be flexible\, experi
 enced\, or able to touch your toes. Just bring your mat and yourself—we
 ’ll take it from there.\n\nCome move\, breathe\, and start your Sunday o
 n a good note!
