SUMMARY:Trust Yourself: Making Your Life Story Work for You
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nSo you’re on the
  self-improvement spiritual path\, doing your best to join the amazing new
  future of hope and healing that you know in your heart must be true. You 
 and the world didn’t come this far -- through millions of years of mirac
 ulous evolution\, natural beauty\, and ideal human striving -- only to be 
 trashed by the ignorance and violence of the most unimaginative uninspired
  individuals. Well\, you’re absolutely correct\, so don’t worry. The U
 niverse is alive and it loves you\, with a divine plan that’s unfolding 
 better than we knew. The realities are already split and we turned a corne
 r\, so let’s wave our final goodbyes to those who chose war while we wer
 e working on peace. The US mid-terms were just one indicator\, as more peo
 ple wake up daily to their own contribution for 2027 to be the year that e
 verything changes.\n\nThe question remains: what to do with your personal 
 story? This is no time for denial and spiritual bypassing. Changing timeli
 nes doesn’t mean suddenly forgetting all that happened\, nor does forgiv
 eness mean accepting it all so nothing changes. As much as the miracles ar
 e indeed coming -- including open contact with higher beings\, new levels 
 of psychic guidance\, and mass healing awakenings -- the real shift is dee
 per and more profound still. The very meaning of time and space is forever
  redefined so that the problems we had never existed. We humans certainly 
 struggled and suffered\, but unnecessarily. The true challenge of Earth wa
 s never to make paradise\, because it was already here. You can’t fix wh
 at isn’t broken\; you can only start using it properly.\n\nThis is the m
 agic of reframing. When you suddenly understand what things really mean an
 d how the Universe is built for success\, then reality becomes fun and eas
 y. Including your personal life? Especially your personal life! This is no
 t just a theory\; you are the Universe in the focus of you\, learning how 
 to be the best you to receive all the resources that you need to thrive. T
 he whole system is interconnected\, with every part functioning only as we
 ll as every other. Does your heart try to do the job of your lungs to oxyg
 enate the blood? Of course not! But by pumping your blood the best that it
  can\, your heart supplies the lungs that supply the heart and vice versa.
  The holographic Universe is even more magical than this metaphor can impl
 y\, because every consciousness creates its own view of the whole. This me
 ans that while you must depend on how others function\, you are never at t
 he mercy of their decisions for you. Make your own choices and others will
  follow. When you change\, they change. It’s a mirror.\n\nIn effect\, yo
 ur personal lifestyle is your control panel on your own Universe in the mu
 ltiverse. This may be hard to believe at first because we were taught the 
 false negative beliefs of domination. The biggest baddest people supposedl
 y rule\, so our personal histories were filled with abuse. The spiritual p
 ath became the busy work of endless healing and forgiving\, in the hope th
 at our abusers would learn to join us in a better tomorrow. That fantasy c
 rashed on the rocks of increasingly cruel behavior\, as the dominators per
 fected their dehumanizing systems of narcissistic demagoguery\, insatiable
  exploitation\, and genocidal fascism. With the planetary ecosystem on the
  brink now\, we’ve run out of other cheeks to turn. Jesus said the meek 
 would inherit the Earth\, but pray tell how and when? And how the hell can
  we stop reacting to the hells from our own hellish backstories that drag 
 us down in complex PTSD?\n\nFor this meetup\, be willing to bring both you
 r highest hopes and lowest despairs. We’ll see how the false belief syst
 ems are self-perpetuating by telling you exactly the wrong way to think ab
 out everything. You failed to change other people or fix the world because
  you never had to. You have nothing to be ashamed of in your personal life
  story. True positive beliefs will make you feel excited and empowered to 
 be you\, because truly you wanted to be nobody else. You don’t need to c
 hange as much as you thought you did\, when what changes is the meaning an
 d use of what you’ve already done. You’ll learn to trust yourself as y
 ou reinterpret your life story in the universal process\, whose 7 archetyp
 al stages move your awareness from eternal spirit to sequential human and 
 back again\, for the confidence to create your own reality. We’ll look a
 t the symbols and synchronicities for a brand new predestined future\, and
  conclude with a guided meditation to let our higher self lead us Home fas
 ter and better than we thought possible.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mast
 ery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, w
 ith the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can’t stay you c
 an get the recording. You can signup here for this meeting and visit www.s
 ignupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wish
 es\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teaching and 
 coaching\nquick-links at www.signupISM.com
