SUMMARY:Workshops Before Ballroom Barre with Coach Lori Woods-Gay
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nWant to sharpen yo
 ur technique before heading into our Ballroom Barre workshop? Join Coach-i
 n-Residence Lori Woods-Gay for a series of targeted 50-minute skill-buildi
 ng sessions\, each focused on one essential element of dance movement.\n
 📅 Mondays\, 6:00–6:50 PM:\n• Aug 31 – Partnering: leading & follo
 wing smoothly\n• Sept 21 – Arm Styling: elegance and poise\n• Oct 5 
 – Leg Lines: presentation & posture\n• Nov 16 – Turns & Spins: contr
 ol\, balance & clean rotation\n📍 A Step to Gold Community Ballroom\, 60
 21 Glenwood Avenue\, Raleigh\, NC\n👥 20 slots for focused instruction\n
 💵 $35/class or $120 for all four\nSpaces fill fast — reserve your spo
 t with Melanie today! Call 919-781-6868.\nor Book here: https://www.eventb
 rite.com/e/workshops-before-ballroom-barre-with-coach-lori-woods-gay-ticke
 ts-1998710089682?aff=oddtdtcreator
