SUMMARY:Ballroom Barre Workshop with Coach Lori Woods-Gay (8 slots only)
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nReady to transform
  your dancing from the ground up? Join Coach in Residence **Lori Woods-Gay
 ** for a semi-private\, technique-focused workshop series designed to refi
 ne your body control\, balance\, and core movement mechanics.\n\nInstead o
 f memorizing long routines\, this workshop takes technique to the barre—
 breaking down ballroom’s fundamental components so you can move with con
 trol\, grace\, and effortless connection.\n\n**Event Details:**\n📍 **Lo
 cation:** A Step to Gold Community Ballroom (6021 Glenwood Ave\, Raleigh\,
  NC)\n🗓 **Dates (Mondays):** Aug 31 \\| Sept 21 \\| Oct 5 \\| Nov 16\n
 ⏰ **Time:** 7:00 PM – 8:20 PM\n👥 **Class Size:** Strictly limited t
 o **8 slots** to ensure personalized\, hands-on feedback.\n\n**Pricing:**\
 n\n* **$75** per individual class\n* **$250** when you bundle all 4 sessio
 ns!\n\nSpots are extremely limited due to the small group format. Reserve 
 your ticket in advance to secure your spot! 👇\n🎟 **Reserve Your Spot
 : https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ballroom-barre-workshop-with-coach-lori-woo
 ds-gay-8-slots-available-tickets-1998699878139?aff=oddtdtcreator**
