SUMMARY:Bachata Night @ Komana Brewery in Cary 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🔥 SALSA4LIFE WE
 DNESDAYS 🔥Bachata Takeover! One vibe. One night!\n\nCary’s Wednesday 
 night where the community comes together to DANCE! 💃🏿\n\n🔥 BEGINN
 ER-FRIENDLY DANCE LESSON\n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLOOR\n🔥 COOL A/C + COMFO
 RTABLE DANCE SPACE + FANS\n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 🍻\n🔥 FREE PARKING\n
 🔥 DOOR PRIZE GIVEAWAYS 🎁\n🔥 COME SOLO OR BRING YOUR CREW\n🔥 GR
 EAT MUSIC • GREAT PEOPLE • LATIN DANCING\nWhether you're brand new to 
 Latin dancing or you've been dancing Salsa and Bachata for years\, Salsa4L
 ife Wednesdays is your midweek dance destination!\nCome learn\, meet new p
 eople\, connect with the community\, and dance the night away. ❤️\n\n
 ⏰ 7:15 PM — Doors open & meet-and-greet mixer\n💃🏽 7:30–8:30 PM
  — Salsa & Bachata lesson\n🎁 After class — Free door prize giveaway
 s\n🔥 8:30–11:00 PM — Social dancing\n\n🕺 DJ Giovanni playing the
  best 🎶 Bachata!\n\n📍 KōMANA Brewing Company\n1020 Ryan Road\, Cary
 \, NC\n💵 $10 online and b4 10pm\nTickets: salsa4life.com\n\n🍻 Drink 
 specials available\nNo partner needed. All levels welcome.\n18+ to party 
 • 21+ to drink\n\n🔥 MAKE WEDNESDAY YOUR NEW FAVORITE NIGHT TO DANCE!\
 n📤 SHARE with someone who needs more dancing in their life!\nHosted by 
 Salsa4Life.com\n\n#Salsa4Life #Salsa4LifeWednesdays #LatinDance #SalsaDanc
 ing #BachataDancing #Merengue #LatinMusic #CaryNC #RaleighNC #TriangleNC
